###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Listar produtos
GET {{baseUri}}/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar produto
GET {{baseUri}}/products/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastrar produto
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUri}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Ampligo",
    "unit": "L",
    "price_per_unit": 180.00
}

### Atualizar produto
PUT {{baseUri}}/products/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Ampligo Atualizado",
    "unit": "L",
    "price_per_unit": 195.00
}

### Excluir produto
DELETE {{baseUri}}/products/3
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
